OL,3,GNEWSACall made for the return of
OL,4,Ahospital's A&E
OL,5,
OL,6,FA call has been made for a Lincolnshire
OL,7,Fhospital's urgent treatment centre
OL,8,F(UTC) to be turned back into an A&E
OL,9,Fdepartment.
OL,11,FThe centre opened in 2023 and replaced
OL,12,Fthe A&E at Grantham and District
OL,13,FHospital.
OL,15,FA Freedom of Information (FoI) request
OL,16,Frevealed that last year almost 6,000
OL,17,FUTC patients were admitted to the
OL,18,Fhospital or were transferred to another
OL,19,Fone for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
