OL,3,GNEWSACall made for the return of
OL,4,Ahospital's A&E
OL,5,
OL,6,FCaroline Landon, group chief operating
OL,7,Fofficer at Lincolnshire Community and
OL,8,FHospitals NHS Group, said the service
OL,9,Fwas "equipped to assess and treat the
OL,10,Fvast majority of patients".
